{
  "name": "Form of the Phoenix",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You finally master the spark of fire that dances within you. When you activate your Mantle of Flame feature, you can choose to empower its effects:</p><ul><li>You have a Fly Speed of 40 feet and can hover.</li><li>You have Resistance to all damage.</li><li>If you use your Phoenix Spark, that feature deals an extra 20 fire damage to each creature.</li></ul><p>Once you use this feature, you can't use it again until you finish a Long Rest, unless you spend 7 sorcery points to use it again.</p>",
